        "filing_date": "2026-05-15",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide customer service through which we assist our customers with machinery and software upgrades, spare parts, logistics, customer training in multiple languages, on-site management, maintenance contracts, and project management.",
